# open: `merl` in a service repository, the first minute. The tree lists what .gitignore leaves
# out, dim (.venv, .env); o opens a file by a few letters of its name; / finds whatever the case
# (#5) and n moves on; : jumps to a line; t hides the tree; ? lists the keys; q gives the shell
# back: merl's screen gone, exit status 0.
merl
# the welcome screen beside the tree
wait Open a file (fuzzy)
key o
type uow
key Enter
wait app/uow.py  1:1  [code]
# `db` found for DB, seven of them, and n to the second
key /
type DB
wait 1/7
key Enter n
wait app/uow.py  8:14  [code]  2/7
key :
type 15
key Enter
wait app/uow.py  15:1
# the tree hidden, the help over the code
key t ?
wait Go to definition of the word under the cursor
key Escape q
wait merl exited: 0
# Enter in a list with nothing matched keeps the list and its query: Backspace fixes the typo
# and Enter opens the file (#288).
merl
wait Open a file (fuzzy)
key t o
type modelx
wait Files (0/
key Enter BSpace
wait Files (5/
key Enter
wait app/models.py  1:1
# The keys of the lists and panels (#310). In the file list PgDn / PgUp page and Up moves: Enter
# opens the row it stands on. Tab puts the focus in the tree, on the open file: Down / Up move,
# Right opens a directory and Left closes it, Enter opens a file. In the help Down / Up scroll.
# N goes back to the match before, and p shows a Markdown file rendered. The list is the
# project's for `a`, a letter in the name of no file opened before (#406).
key o
type a
wait Files (44/
key PageDown PageDown PageUp Up*8 Enter
wait app/service.py  1:1  [code]
key t Tab
wait app/service.py  1:1  [tree]
key Down Down Right
wait orders.min.json
key Left
wait ▸ data
key Up Enter
wait app/uow.py  1:1  [code]
key ?
wait Switch focus between tree and code
key Down Up Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait Close an overlay, leave edit mode
key Escape o
type notes.md
key Enter
wait docs/notes.md  1:1
key /
type order
key Enter n n N
wait 2/14
key Escape p
wait ━━━━━━━━━━
# The file list reads the query as typed (#519): `.py$` looks for a `$` in the path, so nothing
# matches, where `$` used to anchor the end of the path and list every Python file.
key Escape o
type .py$
wait Files (0/
key Escape
# With nothing typed the file list holds only the files opened before, the open one on top and
# the cursor on the one before it, so o and Enter go back there (#406).
key o
wait recently opened
key Enter
wait app/uow.py  1:1
# With the focus in the tree, the keys that move up and down move the tree (#889): from uow.py `}`
# goes to the next folder row, data, then deploy, and `{` back to data, which Right opens; Ctrl+D
# goes half a page down, to the last row here, README.md, and Enter opens it; Ctrl+U, PgUp and
# PgDn page, Shift+End goes to the last row as End does, Ctrl+Home to the first row, .github,
# and Enter unfolds it.
key Tab } } { Right
wait refunds-2026-08.csv
key C-d Enter
wait README.md  1:1
key Tab C-u PgUp PgDn S-End C-Home Enter
wait ▸ workflows
